   "text": "1 Filter bar: Cycle | Region | Product Line | Sales Division (LEs outside write scope with lock icon, read-only) | Plant (multi-select + (unassigned plant)) | Cluster (+ (no cluster)) |\nPlanning model search | [Apply]   Sort by: Planning model | Plant | Cluster\nRight: segmented control Rows: [Planning model | Order Intake level] (2nd label = Product line / Product family / Planning model; disabled with tooltip at planning-model level)  [Import\nfile… -> S-09]  [Export to Excel]. Tail & Passenger Lifts never listed.",
   "originalText": "1 Filter bar: Cycle | Region | Product Line | Sales Division (LEs outside write scope with lock icon, read-only) | Plant (multi-select + (unassigned plant)) | Cluster (+ (no cluster)) |\nPlanning model search | [Apply]   Sort by: Planning model | Plant | Cluster\nRight: segmented control Rows: [Planning model | Order Intake level] (2nd label = Product line / Product family / Planning model; disabled with tooltip at planning-model level)  [Import\nfile… -> S-09]  [Export to Excel]. Tail & Passenger Lifts never listed.",
