   "text": "Grey = read-only (actual months show Invoiced External / Order Intake External / month-end inventory; '—'\nwhere none). Enter saves (check icon); paste block; right-click History… -> S-32; 'Yours — personal';\n'spread'; header spinner 'recalculating'. Value gap blank with 'no price' / 'no FX rate' warning.",
   "originalText": "Grey = read-only (actual months show Invoiced External / Order Intake External / month-end inventory; '—'\nwhere none). Enter saves (check icon); paste block; right-click History… -> S-32; 'Yours — personal';\n'spread'; header spinner 'recalculating'. Value gap blank with 'no price' / 'no FX rate' warning.",
   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
