   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5 Expanded Requested cell - per-plant sub-rows: plant | MK (if several) | share % | units | frozen months | lock icon when frozen. Preferred plant marked; other allowed plants (NW-08) at 0 % as alternatives;\n(unassigned plant) sub-row has no zone. Sub-rows + unassigned = cell. Tooltip per plant: zone length, end month, default source, exception.\nBadge 'twin re-split · +n at Northfield · −n at Niagara · <landing time>' (previous values in tooltip, History S-32). Sub-row action [Move to <twin plant>…] (units field); 'outside sourcing rule' flag in a personal\nscenario. Under plant/cluster filter: Sales/OI/actuals read-only; Requested sub-rows editable (CP-08).",
   "originalText": "5 Expanded Requested cell - per-plant sub-rows: plant | MK (if several) | share % | units | frozen months | lock icon when frozen. Preferred plant marked; other allowed plants (NW-08) at 0 % as alternatives;\n(unassigned plant) sub-row has no zone. Sub-rows + unassigned = cell. Tooltip per plant: zone length, end month, default source, exception.\nBadge 'twin re-split · +n at Northfield · −n at Niagara · <landing time>' (previous values in tooltip, History S-32). Sub-row action [Move to <twin plant>…] (units field); 'outside sourcing rule' flag in a personal\nscenario. Under plant/cluster filter: Sales/OI/actuals read-only; Requested sub-rows editable (CP-08).",
   "fontSize": 9,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
