   "text": "4 Order Intake level mode: rows LE | Region | category at set level (e.g. Crane (E)) + caret to planning models; only Order Intake forecast editable, other measures read-only category totals (FMS '—'). Typing on\na category row opens S-16 Aggregate edit with spread preview. At planning-model level the control is disabled.",
   "originalText": "4 Order Intake level mode: rows LE | Region | category at set level (e.g. Crane (E)) + caret to planning models; only Order Intake forecast editable, other measures read-only category totals (FMS '—'). Typing on\na category row opens S-16 Aggregate edit with spread preview. At planning-model level the control is disabled.",
