   "text": "Share breakdown drawer (bottom, collapsible): 'Requested production · <LE> · <region> · <PM> · Oct 2026 = 160'\nTable per MK x plant share: MK (ID + caption) | plant | zone status ('Frozen until Nov 2026 · 22 working days at Northfield' / 'Open') | share units (editable; frozen -> S-17) | source (order book · 3 orders ·\nlatest dates 12–19 Oct / planner / manual exception — <reason> [Remove exception] / UNASSIGNED plant — no frozen default / order book missing — last default kept / twin re-split — order book / twin override)\nTotal check: 'Shares 160 = cell 160'. Note: Editing the cell total spreads the change over the open shares only.",
   "originalText": "Share breakdown drawer (bottom, collapsible): 'Requested production · <LE> · <region> · <PM> · Oct 2026 = 160'\nTable per MK x plant share: MK (ID + caption) | plant | zone status ('Frozen until Nov 2026 · 22 working days at Northfield' / 'Open') | share units (editable; frozen -> S-17) | source (order book · 3 orders ·\nlatest dates 12–19 Oct / planner / manual exception — <reason> [Remove exception] / UNASSIGNED plant — no frozen default / order book missing — last default kept / twin re-split — order book / twin override)\nTotal check: 'Shares 160 = cell 160'. Note: Editing the cell total spreads the change over the open shares only.",
   "fontSize": 9,
